759 0 obj
<</Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/Alt (Spectrum of four profiles from no dependency on a geographic hub to greater local capability. No Hub has no hub or gateway; Remote Hub connects privately to a geographic hub; a Selective Hub hosts selected shared services such as private DNS, a virtual network gateway, and Azure Monitor; a Full Hub adds comprehensive shared services including Azure Firewall.)
